From 01f8dac1564a7f2a0dd8025a03badd642ab3ba45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fountain5405 <Fountain5405@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] fcmps: extract verifier_layout and
 build_verifier_circuits

No behaviour change. The layout of the verifier circuits (the tapes,
branches, input openings and blind claims the construction consumes) is
computed by verifier_layout, and the construction itself by
build_verifier_circuits, so the next commit can build the circuits more than
once. Code moves only; the transcript operations and their order are
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
